71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MkYnTtJEyTcQ7kNvwGt-1Ag&_nc_oc=AdpG-u0pEJ5msAaHq_cA1jXc9q3nwLlCf58YKw4l2P6O6YUWuKgx-zj0SG56EzVMCtM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMqxrl3D6SxQlauAjRzK4Vp7mKi5S86LIPDUeVJxv4wlw&oe=6ACBC2F9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dgbn2YPBo9QQ7kNvwEjuL7g&_nc_oc=AdpYFELPf5dnl3lYbfVp1nUOaEbO98Mb4AXq20AESG2fHb7oqd_WK9Q3VmHLLOlzLjo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMXQkQJpd9U07B1uNHIpxXXDU-aPzy2DuV2ov4tmpQx3Q&oe=6ACB9D93"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mWvJ0Bt7KB4Q7kNvwFfdoYu&_nc_oc=Ado1mKltsK-sX3s_SOtWWmf98AN-06eU38_bs3Murzj3Uh-AuQZHu2nz5OAc8cq3EuQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNEiYj73AP5wh_skgSkHZ4CsaxWBcBwix5ipEl2Jy07dA&oe=6ACB9BDA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: